OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FApart from the chance of an
OL,6,Fearly light shower across north and
OL,7,Fmid Wales, Monday promises to be
OL,8,Fgenerally dry with bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells, mainly in the east. Feeling
OL,10,Fquite warm in the westerly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy, with some
OL,13,Fclear spells in the east. The cloud
OL,14,Fwill bring showery outbreaks of rain
OL,15,For drizzle, chiefly over the hills and
OL,16,Fmountains.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
