OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dull and cloudy start, with
OL,6,Fa continued chance of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle through the morning. Becoming
OL,8,Fdrier and brighter during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling very warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FRemaining largely settled over the
OL,14,Fcoming days with plenty of sunshine.
OL,15,FVery warm, with temperatures rising
OL,16,Ffurther and becoming hot locally by
OL,17,FWednesday. Cooler and less settled
OL,18,Ffrom Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
